<title>UK: T&amp;N says cancels scrip dividend alternative.</title>
<headline>T&amp;N says cancels scrip dividend alternative.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Automotive components and engineering group T&amp;N has cancelled its final scrip dividend alternative due to a fall in the company's share price.</p>
<p>Shareholders are to receive their final 3.0 pence per share dividend in cash.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
